## 7. What Happens Next (Handover Protocol)

The system currently contains **demonstration data** — sample students, sample teachers, sample fee records — for testing and showcase purposes.

When the school is ready to go live, the Head of School (or designated admin) performs the following steps, entirely within the portal:

1. Log in to the system
2. Click the profile icon → **"Handover — Clear All Data"**
3. Confirm the action
4. **The system wipes all demo data, retains the structure, and the school begins entering real data from day one.**

From that point forward, the school owns a clean, live, production system. No engineer intervention is required.

